  m_text: "We propose an Open Door Policy in China for the following reasons:\r\n\u2022
    <u>Prevent serious conflicts of interest</u> among world powers in the Orient,
    ensure American business and citizen rights in the region.\r\n\u2022 No nation
    should get a head start on commerce and navigation."
